drill on the coastline."}], "text": "", "id": 2}], "id": 2, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Offshore practices are ..."}]}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_8"}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 9, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " \nTalking our way through the crisis.\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Select the correct answer.\n"}]}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 10, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": []}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn8le09ob06re7pdf01.pdf"}]}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nPractice how to word things carefully.\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le09ob06re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le09ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le09ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "00100", "image": "engenn8le09ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Mr. Farmani? This is Janet Ellis, from Polygon. How are you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Fine, thank you. How are you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Well, under the circumstances. Mr. Farmani, I would like to arrange an urgent meeting with you tomorrow if it is possible.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: I have a full schedule tomorrow,  but I will accommodate you if this is urgent.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: If you could do that, I would appreciate it.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: May I ask you what this is concerning?"}, {"time": "26000", "image": "engenn8le09ob06re2img07.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: We have received a disturbing report about some of Holly's offshore practices. Unfortunately, ethical concerns have hit social media and Holly's is already beginning to face serious image problems. I was wondering whether you were aware of this. If we don't deal with this immediately, there could be boycotts of your product. Petitions have begun.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: I have no idea what you're talking about. What is the source of this report? Is it credible?"}, {"time": "55000", "image": "engenn8le09ob06re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: If I wasn't certain, I wouldn't have approached you. We have done our own investigation into the facts before contacting you. Concerns have been corroborated.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Well then, let's schedule tomorrow afternoon to discuss this business. I will rearrange my schedule.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I appreciate that. Miranda will come with me if that's alright.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Yes. And I'm sure we will be able to work things out.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>:  I believe there are possibilities if we come to agreement in dealing with these concerns. Mr. Farmani, Polygon is committed to facing this problem if we can work together.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: I am glad to hear that, Janet. I will see you tomorrow."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Controlling the Story"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Arranging a Meeting with Farmani"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe rules through a wider range of language and expressions in both work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Use of <span class=\"italic\">Conditional Tense</span> "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "The <span class=\"italic\">Conditional Tense</span>  using 'if' is used when a statement, event or request is dependent on another thing happening. A main clause is followed by an 'if' clause that gives a condition to the first statement."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The <span class=\"italic\">Conditional </span> is often used to soften what one has to say. In a delicate situation, you don't want to sound demanding or controlling. The <span class=\"italic\">Conditional Tense</span>  is very handy at this time because it makes you sound like you are making a suggestion or request rather than commanding the other person."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are two ways to soften what you really want to say with the <span class=\"italic\">Conditional <span class=\"italic\">Tense</span></span>:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "1. You can begin your sentence with the conditional."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change this original statement:<br>I want you to come talk with me."}, {"type": "text", "content": "... by adding a condition:<br>If you are able to leave your work ... please come talk with me.<br>If it is not too inconvenient... please come talk with me.<br>If you don't mind ... please come talk with me."}, {"type": "text", "content": "2. You can add a condition to the end of your statement or request."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Original statement:<br>           I need your help on this project.<br>Statement with condition: <br>I need your help on this project if you can <br>                                         find the time /  please come talk with me /<br>                                          if it's not too much trouble."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The conditional can also be used to soften an unpleasant statement or prediction by offering a solution. This is done by using 'if' + a negative statement. I.e., \"If you don't ... \""}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Unpleasant or Demanding Statement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Original statement plus condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Alternative placement of conditional\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" We must work together\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" We must work together if we are going to achieve success.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If we are going to achieve success we must work together.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Our clients will never believe us.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Our clients will never believe us if we don't act now.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If we don't act now, our clients will never believe us.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You might not see her again\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You might not see her again if you don't apologize.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If you don't apologize, you might not see her again.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Dealing with a Difficult Client"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " At times our clients, coworkers or supervisors may be difficult to work with. Because people often feel more sensitive at these times, language must be worded especially carefully. It is important to communicate that you are listening and open to ideas or suggestions, even if it is not convenient for you."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">1. Expressions that show you are listening:</span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>Alright / Well then / Okay, <span class=\"underline\">let's...</span> </li></ul> </span> <span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>I hear what you are saying</li></ul> </span> <span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>I know what you mean.</li></ul> </span> <span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>May I ask what this is concerning?</li></ul> </span> <span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>What would you like from me?</li></ul> </span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">2. To show you are willing to accommodate someone:</span> <br> <ol><li>Let them know your situation isn't easy</li><li>Then tell them how you will try to be agreeable</li></ol> "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Your situation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" How you'll accommodate\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I am very busy / The timing is awkward ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" ... but I will try to / but I will see what I can do\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Things really aren't ready...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" ... but we're working on it / but we'll work on it\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" This will be difficult ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" ... but I'm sure we can ... work something out / figure something out\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" My schedule is full ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" ... but I will ... rearrange things for you / see what I can do / make room somewhere\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to accommodate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to fit in with someone's needs or wishes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I will accommodate you if this is urgent."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le09ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to navigate a difficult meeting."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "under the circumstances"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "even with or because of the way things are at the moment"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am well, under the circumstances."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le09ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "full schedule"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a planned time period that is so busy that nothing more can be planned"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have a full schedule tomorrow."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le09ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "concerning"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "about; related to"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(preposition)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: May I ask you what this is concerning?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le09ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "offshore practices"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the things a company does regularly outside its own country"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have received a disturbing report about some of Holly's offshore practices."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le09ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "boycott"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a group decision to stop buying products or having any relations with a company"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If we don't deal with this immediately, there could be boycotts of your product."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le09ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "petition "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a formal request to make change, with signatures from many people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Petitions have begun."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le09ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to corroborate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to confirm; prove true "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Concerns have been corroborated."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le09ob06aud09"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Imagine a difficult situation with an important client that you do not wish to offend. What is the client demanding?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down several requests that your client has made politely, using the conditional form."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Now write down several things that make your situation difficult."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Add several ways that will try to accommodate your client."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a back-and-forth dialogue that could occur between you and your client, using these requests and statements with accommodations."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the dialogue together with your partner. Have your partner read the client's lines while you read your own lines that will accommodate."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Now read your partner's dialogue together."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I make polite requests using the conditional form."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make verbal accommodations to difficult clients."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a realistic dialogue between business partners in a delicate meeting."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read a business partner's expressions of accommodation to a difficult client."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn8le09ob06re1img01.jpg"}]}